#40701
The Forest~
Darkness makes it hard to see clearly in any direction. Gnarled
tree trunks, thick weeds and ferns seem to create the walls of
this ominous place. A thick canopy of tangled branches and slime
covered black leaves give the area a tunnel effect, blocking out
all light.
Paths seem to have been created by spaces where the trees did not 
grow or were deliberately forgotten.
~
